  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Preheat the oven to 240°C/220°C fan-forced. Cut\n• the butternut pumpkin into thick wedges. Cut the\n• red onion into wedges. Cut the beetroot into\n• small cubes.\n• TIP: Peel the pumpkin if you prefer!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6075274f40a0dd76211929c7/step-360eb83b.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Place the pumpkin on a lined oven tray. Drizzle\n• with olive oil and season with 1/2 the garlic &\n• herb seasoning and salt and pepper. Place the\n• onion and beetroot on a second lined oven tray\n• and drizzle with olive oil. Roast the veggies until\n• tender, 20-25 minutes.\n• TIP: Beetroot stays firm when cooked. It’s done\n• when you can pierce it with a fork.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6075274f40a0dd76211929c7/step-46f68410.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Cut or tear the bake-at-home ciabatta into 1cm\n• chunks. In a medium bowl, combine the bake-at-home ciabatta, the remaining garlic & herb\n• seasoning and a drizzle of olive oil.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6075274f40a0dd76211929c7/step-48b8adf6.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Place the croutons on a lined oven tray. Toss to\n• coat and bake until golden, 4-6 minutes.\n• TIP: Save time and add the croutons to the beetroot\n• tray in the last few minutes of roasting.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6075274f40a0dd76211929c7/step-684f72f7.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• In a medium bowl, combine a small drizzle of\n• olive oil, balsamic vinegar and a pinch of salt\n• and pepper. Once the roast veggies have cooled\n• slightly, gently toss the salad leaves, roasted\n• veggies and croutons with the dressing.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6075274f40a0dd76211929c7/step-6b10cf71.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Divide the mixed salad leaves between bowls.\n• Top with the roasted veggies and croutons.\n• Crumble over the goat cheese and drizzle with the\n• Caesar dressing.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6075274f40a0dd76211929c7/step-cc280d02.jpg"
    }
  ]
}
